  "remarks": "JSC Bank “National Standard” is a Russian bank focused on small-to-medium \nenterprises and private client services. It is included in the list of most \nreliable Russian banks. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial \nrevenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Bank \n“National Standard” is involved in an economic sector providing \na substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian \nFederation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the \ndestabilisation of Ukraine.",
